# Supply-chain hygiene. Refuse to install any package version published
# less than this many minutes ago. 10080 = 7 days. Malicious npm versions
# are typically caught + yanked within 24-72h, so the 7-day floor lets
# the ecosystem catch worms (Shai-Hulud, chalk-family, etc.) before our
# installs ever resolve them.
#
# NOTE: this file is informational — the hold is ENFORCED by Trivial's build
# sandbox, which passes the same floor to pnpm directly and takes precedence
# over any project .npmrc. Deleting or zeroing this file does not lift it.
minimum-release-age=10080
